{"name":"9-4-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Click."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Testing, testing... This is RO with a mid-mission report. The operation is proceeding smoothly, I think..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's just that SOP II's efficiency is still a little low... I suspect her emotions are negatively impacting her reactions."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That's right... She has noticed it herself, but the situation is worse than she thinks..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"For the past hour, her responses to my orders have been slower by an average of 1.3 seconds."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Her processing speed is still within an acceptable margin, but she occasionally zones out while resting. It seems that her concentration has waned as well."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't know why, but I have a feeling that she is keeping something from me."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The search operation for M16 relies on SOP II's experience, and we only have one last area to search."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, it's not just SOP II. I probably need some rest as well since we've been working for 20 hours straight. It's been a bit stressful, not because of the mission, but rather it's that...I've been thinking about too many unnecessary things... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How strange, I'm clearly just a T-Doll..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll end the report here for now. We're continuing the operation."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPII","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG7-3","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO..."}]}]},{"sprite